{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53202","headline":"诗偈 二十七 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愚人打瓮破，求人望锢护。\n恶法得钱财，布施拟补处。\n物色不相当，此事无烦做。\n纵然有少福，那得地狱去。\n罪福当头行，何时相值遇。\n自本犹折却，安得有利路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}